 of jet fuel every hour.</i>

00:12:26.945 --> 00:12:28.547 align:start size:88% position:13%
- Not great.
- Pilot: Welcome aboard.

00:12:28.580 --> 00:12:31.316 align:start size:88% position:13%
- Should be a nice day
  for flying. Thank you.
- ( chimes )

00:12:31.349 --> 00:12:33.886
<i> So, we logged onto a site
 called myclimate.org</i>

00:12:33.919 --> 00:12:35.554
<i>that's a nonprofit organization
 that helps you</i>

00:12:35.587 --> 00:12:39.124
<i> calculate and offset
 your carbon footprint.</i>

00:12:39.157 --> 00:12:40.325
