otherwise be using open fires
to make their food.

00:12:49.835 --> 00:12:52.070
<i> I don't think
 that offsets our solution
 to climate change,</i>

00:12:52.103 --> 00:12:53.539
<i> but it's a good way
 of acknowledging</i>

00:12:53.572 --> 00:12:55.207
<i> that our consumer choices</i>

00:12:55.240 --> 00:12:57.142
<i> have impacts
 around the world,</i>

00:12:57.175 --> 00:13:00.179
and our investments
and donations can have
impacts, too.

00:13:07.352 --> 00:13:08.921
<i> Can you see it?</i>

00:13:08.954 --> 00:13:11.023
<i> That's
 the Pipistrel ALPHA Electro.</i>

00:13:11.056 --> 00:13:12.958
<i> They're adorable.
 I mean, I just want to put</i>

00:13:12.991 --> 00:13:15.227
<i> little googly eyes
 on the front of that thing.</i>

00:13:15.260 --> 00:13:17.496
<i> It's the world's first
 production electric airplane.</i>

00:13:17.529 --> 00:13:20.532
<i> And I'm here in Fresno
 to talk to Joseph Oldham,</i>

00:13:20.565 --> 00:13:23.235
<i> who is a veteran pilot
 who played a big role</i>

00:13:23.268 --> 00:13:25.204
<i> in bringing these planes
 to California</i>

