 training program.</i>

00:13:29.608 --> 00:13:31.276 align:start size:72% position:28%
Pretty amazing project.

00:13:31.309 --> 00:13:33.946 line:0%
We ran emission
calculations

00:13:33.979 --> 00:13:37.282 line:0%
on the reduction
in greenhouse gases

00:13:37.315 --> 00:13:39.551
<i> from just these
 four little aircraft</i>

00:13:39.584 --> 00:13:43.021
