operations for a year.

00:13:43.054 --> 00:13:46.358
And it's like reducing
carbon emissions by 92 tons,

00:13:46.391 --> 00:13:48.227 align:start size:59% position:41%
which is pretty
significant

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:50.996 align:start size:81% position:19%
- for four little
  airplanes, right?
