- That.

00:13:55.233 --> 00:13:57.603 align:start size:97% position:3%
- Just that.
- Wow, it's like three inches.

00:13:57.636 --> 00:13:59.638 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, it's--
it's very small.

00:13:59.671 --> 00:14:02.074 align:start size:72% position:28%
And then these
are the battery packs.

00:14:02.107 --> 00:14:03.575 align:start size:72% position:28%
There's two of these.

00:14:03.608 --> 00:14:06.311
There's one up here
in this front compartment,

00:14:06.344 --> 00:14:10.148 align:start size:72% position:28%
