00:14:40.545 --> 00:14:43.081
- So, the plane is on now?
- Yes, the plane is on now.

00:14:43.114 --> 00:14:45.351 align:start size:47% position:53%
Oh, my gosh,
it's so quiet.

00:15:12.677 --> 00:15:15.314 align:start size:84% position:16%
