Right there.

00:16:27.152 --> 00:16:28.320
So cool.

00:16:28.353 --> 00:16:31.123
Nice and easy.

00:16:43.201 --> 00:16:46.538 align:start size:84% position:16%
- Hey.
- Hey, how's it--
  oh, is that a plane?

00:16:46.571 --> 00:16:48.673 align:start size:88% position:13%
So, I got to go
to California for this story

00:16:48.706 --> 00:16:51.176 align:start size:81% position:19%
'cause we're looking
into the future of flying,

00:16:51.209 --> 00:16:54.212 size:84% position:58%
and what I got to see there
was an electric airplane.

00:16:54.245 --> 00:16:57.682 align:start size:78% position:22%
It's just a small
two-seater plane that can
fly for about 80 minutes.

00:16:57.715 --> 00:17:00.218 align:start size:84% position:16%
- Cool.
- But that's
  on batteries alone.

00:17:00.251 --> 00:17:01.520 align:start size:66% position:34%
- Oh, wow.
- Yeah.

00:17:01.553 --> 00:17:03.055 align:start size:78% position:22%
- No fuel? 
- No fuel, just-- 

00:17:03.088 --> 00:17:04.456 align:start size:81% position:19%
- That's great.
- Yeah, electricity.

00:17:04.489 --> 00:17:07.059 align:start size:59% position:41%
