Oof.

00:17:14.732 --> 00:17:15.801 align:start size:66% position:34%
They're heavy, right?

00:17:15.834 --> 00:17:19.738 align:start position:0% line:0%
Yeah, they're
25-pound plates.

00:17:19.771 --> 00:17:21.440 align:start position:0%
What are you gonna do
with these after?

